  "description": "Fuaran.Core.Query — the declarative, cross-domain data-acquisition seam (Phase 46): the data-acquisition sibling to Capability. A Query is a serialisable, typed declaration of external data to fetch (relational rows, retrieval hits, file/asset ingest, reference lookup) producing a Column Table; the host supplies the resolver (witness pattern). Default-deny registry, typed param validation, Phase 27 capture keying, Fable-clean codec. FSharp.Core only.",
